OL,3,GNEWSAHow fields of Fermanagh helped
OL,4,ADaisy Edgar-Jones prepare for her
OL,5,Alatest film
OL,6,
OL,7,FActress Daisy Edgar-Jones is no
OL,8,Fstranger to Ireland, having spent five
OL,9,Fmonths in the country filming hit drama
OL,10,FNormal People which was released in
OL,11,F2020.
OL,13,FBut it was actually fields in County
OL,14,FFermanagh, where some of her family
OL,15,Flive, that helped her prepare for the
OL,16,Frole of beloved character Elinor
OL,17,FDashwood in Jane Austen's Sense and
OL,18,FSensibility, some 20 years before.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
