OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHow fields of Fermanagh helped
OL,4,ADaisy Edgar-Jones prepare for her
OL,5,Alatest film
OL,6,
OL,7,FHer mother is from County Down and
OL,8,FEdgar-Jones, now 28, spent her
OL,9,Fchildhood roaming the Northern Irish
OL,10,Fcountryside.
OL,12,F"I remember big long summers when I was
OL,13,Fvery young in Fermanagh in the fields
OL,14,Fwhich definitely helped with my Sense
OL,15,Fand Sensibility journey because I was
OL,16,Fdoing a lot of the similar wandering
OL,17,Faround, with not much to do, under the
OL,18,Fbig sky and I love being here," she
OL,19,Fsaid.
